                <pb facs="0627" n="547" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg547"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell reports that an explanation has been requested by the Venezuelan
                    Government of the entry by the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Mayflower</hi>
                    of a closed port in the island of Margarita, and asks what answer he shall
                    make.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
